{"version":1,"content":"<p>王灝兒（JW）去年中傳戀上從事演唱會事業的足球班主王至尊（Jim Wong），兩人早前更傳出早在去年11月在土耳其秘婚，唯兩位當事人一直未肯開口回應。</p><p>JW終於在今天（30日）推出新歌《JW2情歌》時認愛，並表示新歌是她與王至尊的愛情故事，她以喜帖形式邀請樂迷一同見證2人展開人生新一頁。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:45:38.040599+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:23:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.987802+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:40:13.865164+00:00","content_hash":"707ad3eaae59257ec6e10da7ff5399a31484aa217953c5db5682a1293f6b5ff0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}